WEBVTT

00:05:29.781 --> 00:05:32.598
At the 2014 MTV Video Music Awards,

00:05:32.622 --> 00:05:36.388
she performed in front of the word
"feminist" 10 feet high.

00:05:36.412 --> 00:05:38.643
It was a glorious spectacle to see


00:05:38.643 --> 00:05:41.643
this pop star openly embracing feminism

00:05:41.643 --> 00:05:43.372
and letting young women and men know

00:05:43.396 --> 00:05:46.499
that being a feminist
is something to celebrate.

00:05:46.985 --> 00:05:50.644
As the moment faded, cultural critics
began endlessly debating

00:05:50.668 --> 00:05:53.328
whether or not Beyoncé was,
indeed, a feminist.

00:05:53.693 --> 00:05:55.574
They graded her feminism,

00:05:55.598 --> 00:05:59.866
instead of simply taking a grown,
accomplished woman at her word.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:02.528
(Laughter)